# Annotation Property: obo:NCIT_P378 (Definition Source)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:NCIT_P378 "NCI") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCIT_P378 "A property representing the organization that is the supplier or owner of each DEFINITION or ALT_DEFINITION associated with a concept.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:NCIT_P378 "Definition Source")



